                "description": "Pre-generated safety guidelines injected into the guardrail's system prompt.\n- ``\"\"`` (default): bare guardrail -- no experiences. The analyzer still separates actor from judge; it just classifies without distilled tool-specific guidance.\n- Any non-empty string: used as-is. The intended pattern is to call one of the helpers (``default_safety_experiences()``, ``load_safety_experiences(tool_names)``, ``auto_detect_safety_experiences()``) which require the ``[toolshield]`` optional extra (``pip install openhands-sdk[toolshield]``). Callers with their own source of guidelines can pass any custom string.",
